  "description": "Subject: EiffelTestSuiteStartedEvent \u2013 Regression Test Suite (ID\u202f=\u202f123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000)\n\nThe CI pipeline \u201cCI Pipeline\u201d (host\u202f=\u202fbuild.example.com, domain\u202f=\u202fmy-domain, URI\u202f=\u202fhttps://build.example.com/job/123) has published an EiffelTestSuiteStartedEvent (type\u202f=\u202fEiffelTestSuiteStartedEvent, version\u202f=\u202f1.1.0) at timestamp\u202f=\u202f1718425600000 (June\u202f15\u202f2024). The event is tagged with \u201cintegration\u201d and \u201crelease-1.2\u201d. It was serialized using the serializer com.example:ci-serializer:2.0.1 and secured with SDM credentials (author\u202f=\u202fjohn.doe@example.com, encryptedDigest\u202f=\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f6).  \n\nThe test suite named \u201cRegression Test Suite\u201d belongs to the categories \u201cregression\u201d and \u201cnightly\u201d and is classified as FUNCTIONAL, PERFORMANCE, and SECURITY. Live logging is available via the suite\u2011log at https://logs.example.com/suite/123.log. Additional custom data records the environment as \u201cstaging\u201d and a retryCount of 2. This suite start is linked to the cause event with ID\u202f=\u202f9f8e7d6c-5b4a-3c2d-9e8f-7a6b5c4d3e2f.",
